# Files a Vercel build never reads, kept out of every deployment's upload.
#
# EVERY RULE IS ANCHORED WITH A LEADING SLASH. An unanchored `brand` matched components/brand/
# and public/brand/ too, which removed the logo component and failed a production build. Vercel
# applies this file to Git deployments as well as CLI ones, so a loose pattern breaks both.
/.impeccable
/.claude
/project-tree.txt
/brand
